                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "COULD have maybe gotten around that.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           },
                           {
                              "type" : "hardBreak"
                           },
                           {
                              "text" : "But easier to disable overall.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Also weird - on command-line had to disable the error with no-sanitize=vptr even though not a vptr failure.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "COULD try no_sanitize(\"vptr\") maybe - but lets just give this a rest and retry with gcc8.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
